File Path 
•An HTML File Path is used to describe the location of a file in a website 
folder.
•It is use to link  image file, CSS file, Js file ,video etc.. 
•Attribute: Src
•Ex:
<img src=‘1.jpg’> 
<img src=“images/1.jpg”> 
<img src=“../1.jpg”> 

