Types of IFrame 
HTML iframe is used to display a nested webpage (a webpage within 
webpage). Used to embed webpage or a YouTube video. 
<iframe src=“URL”></iframe> 
Attributes: 
Src
width
height
frameborder 
allowfullscreen 

