GSFCU & Values 
Reference: Please write / cite the references used (If any) for this slide (Font: Verdana, Size: 09, Color: Black) In every lecture, Faculty may talk on any of the following: 
•DCS & GSFCU Portal: Remind students to use DCS, talk about it’s features and instruct all to visit GSFCU website 
